    "profile_text": {
        "body": "AeroVironment Inc is a public company headquartered in Arlington, Virginia, trading under the ticker AVAV. According to its website, it describes itself as a leading manufacturer of Unmanned Aircraft Systems, Unmanned Aerial Vehicles, Loitering Munition Systems, and Unmanned Ground Vehicles used for surveillance and reconnaissance by the United States Military, U.S. allies and Commercial Industries. The site also states that AV manufactures High-Altitude Pseudo-Satellites.\n\nThe company's site describes MacCready Works as its advanced development group, which it says turns concepts into mission-ready autonomous systems. The site says the group is inspired by Dr. Paul B. MacCready, Jr., and that its engineers, roboticists, and AI researchers design next-generation robotic systems across air, land, and sea. It describes a \"MacCready Method\" of building fast, testing relentlessly, and deploying advantage, with small multidisciplinary teams aiming to move ideas into operational capability in months.\n\nThe company is registered with the SEC under CIK 0001368622. Its recorded law exposure is in Virginia, with a count of 152.",
